  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Bảng số liệu ghép nhóm về điểm thi môn Toán của 60 thí sinh\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Điểm</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>80</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Số thí sinh</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>27</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>16</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div></li><li>Cỡ mẫu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math>,<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>…</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>60</mn></msub></semantics></math> là điểm thi môn Toán của 60 học sinh và giả sử dãy này đã được sắp xếp theo thứ tự tăng dần. Khi đó, trung vị là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>31</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.<br>Do hai giá trị <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>31</mn></msub></semantics></math> thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên nhóm này chứa trung vị. Do đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>60</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTứ phân vị thứ nhất <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>16</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. Do hai giá trị <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>16</mn></msub></semantics></math> thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên nhóm này chứa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>. Do đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</m